    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm looking to scale my agency and i want to start integrating ai heavily to cut down on our overhead and optimize the workforce. basically i need to know how i can use ai to automate as many roles as possible to boost efficiency without causing a massive wave of employee turnover or morale issues that kills the company culture. what's the best way to do this?",
